{
"n": 6,
"h": "cf5e4af6",
"en_raw": "You came without running away"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "1e011af7",
"en_raw": "Is that all you get praised for?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "96f9a5b8",
"en_raw": "Well then, before we start..."
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "df89d55e",
"en_raw": "what exactly happened at this place"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "09880cf5",
"en_raw": "and what will happen from now on"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "86566a9a",
"en_raw": "I'll tell you one more time"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "9c469d5b",
"en_raw": "Tell me anyway / No need  Have you heard"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "cf71829d",
"en_raw": "the name Hiroshi Yoshii?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "e5dab671",
"en_raw": "He's the grudge"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "df939f2a",
"en_raw": "bound to this crossing"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "6a742244",
"en_raw": "That person decided to jump"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "5627b583",
"en_raw": "here and kill himself"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "a6493a98",
"en_raw": "but he never really meant to die"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "ce2e35fe",
"en_raw": "But he failed to get away"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "ce4b3ee5",
"en_raw": "and first lost both legs..."
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "d0a0980a",
"en_raw": "Then, as he crawled"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "0f08ad67",
"en_raw": "to get off the tracks,"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "437779c5",
"en_raw": "the train on the opposite line came"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "d9ae6463",
"en_raw": "...and this time"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "39590ed5",
"en_raw": "he couldn't dodge, torn apart"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "81d39630",
"en_raw": "Hmm, a well-made tall tale"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "44f59d36",
"en_raw": "According to Lord Tsukuyomi"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "be11820c",
"en_raw": "he wants a new accident"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "3db8a1dc",
"en_raw": "So when you pass through here"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "b705d93c",
"en_raw": "there's something you must"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "7036f8a2",
"en_raw": "never think about"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "d73e5580",
"en_raw": "...That's the White Suicide Note"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "cb8eae73",
"en_raw": "It's the phrase you'll now"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "6f1de243",
"en_raw": "chant at this crossing"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "085ee3da",
"en_raw": "Spare me the talk"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "34424755",
"en_raw": "just tell me already"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "6db72caa",
"en_raw": "What do I do to win?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "fb7b4459",
"en_raw": "If you want to die that badly"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "a9e364f3",
"en_raw": "how to get there"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "350ed370",
"en_raw": "After the signal starts ringing"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "55320aab",
"en_raw": "say 'white suicide note' three times"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "97fe5e52",
"en_raw": "and come back, and you win"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "f9c40171",
"en_raw": "It's a short phrase"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "48e06e51",
"en_raw": "so you'll have time"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "053af184",
"en_raw": "to say it three times"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "499e86ba",
"en_raw": "After the clanging starts"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "15ee0da4",
"en_raw": "'white suicide note' three times"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "0774ffcc",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "8efcc818",
"en_raw": "But the spirit grabs your feet"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "c549004c",
"en_raw": "so I'll fail..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "0decad24",
"en_raw": "Do you seriously believe that?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "cd221d62",
"en_raw": "You understand what to do, right?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "23e3f8d5",
"en_raw": "If you think it's a lie, prove it"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "51e680a3",
"en_raw": "yourself, then"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "3cd618ac",
"en_raw": "Sango, such a dangerous game,"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "4fb6eb4d",
"en_raw": "you should stop..."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "0b855ae2",
"en_raw": "Do it / Quit  Why am I getting timid"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "705d2844",
"en_raw": "If I quit in this situation"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "5278a8be",
"en_raw": "I'm a loser for life"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "1ee11dc6",
"en_raw": "Do it / Quit  ...When Nao says it,"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "cffb439d",
"en_raw": "I always"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "c2a542b9",
"en_raw": "want to do the opposite"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "4e292446",
"en_raw": "Now, what will happen..."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "b8c75fb7",
"en_raw": "Everyone watch"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "3818d020",
"en_raw": "I've wondered for a while"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "fcfd7ec0",
"en_raw": "Sakai, do you really believe"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "f938f62c",
"en_raw": "in this kind of thing?"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "75a018ff",
"en_raw": "What are you getting at?"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "71c29eca",
"en_raw": "A kiddie-trick psychic girl"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "816930b1",
